        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2014, Sobe Wall Mounted Tooth Brush Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known, the Sobe Series Toothbrush Holder is constructed out of brass and is available in ssatin nickel, polished chrome, polished nickel, satin brass and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The modern design is exemplified by the concealed screw mounting that maintains its sleek, contemporary look. A wall mounted toothbrush holder, the Deltana BBS2014 is easy to clean and will look great in even the most sophisticated of homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2014-specifications.gif?v=1704354555\" width=\"450\" height=\"263\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2014 Tooth Brush Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Toothbrush Caddy:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2014.pdf?v=1691095349\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2014 Tooth Brush Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toothbrush holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
