                "title": "Tooth Brush Holder Sobe Series, Deltana BBS2014",
                "description": "Deltana BBS2014 Tooth Brush Holder Sobe Series - Made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known, the Sobe Series Toothbrush Holder is constructed out of brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, polished nickel, satin brass and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The modern design is exemplified by the concealed screw mounting that maintains its sleek, contemporary look. A wall mounted toothbrush holder, the Deltana BBS2014 is easy to clean and will look great in even the most sophisticated of homes.",
